    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are the terror of the night, able to take flight and sense all sounds hidden under the cover of dark. You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li>Increase your Wisdom or Dexterity score by 1, up to a maximum of 20.</li><li>You gain blindsight of 10ft. This blindsight ceases to function if you are deafened.</li><li>You gain a flying speed equal to your movement speed. You cannot benefit from this speed if you are wearing heavy armor.</li></ul>",
